WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.500
Ryu falls after the prerequisite four-button target ender.

2
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:00.950
Standing medium punch intentionally whiffs over the knocked-down Ryu.

3
00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:01.550
The forward dash closes the demonstrated distance.

4
00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:02.850
The normal throw catches Ryu after wake-up.

5
00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:03.200
Ryu is knocked down again by the throw.
